#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "Mshauri wa Kuboresha Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "Boresha Syslog kutoka %s hadi %s? Ujumbe na kanuni zilizopo zitahifadhiwa. Mabadiliko ya muundo yanaweza kuchukua muda."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Unapenda kutumia aina gani ya kusasisha/kusakinisha"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Unapokuwa na majedwali makubwa sana, kufanya Truncate kutakuwa kwa haraka zaidi. Ikiwa una wasiwasi kuhusu data ya kumbukumbu, unaweza kuchagua ama Ndani ya Mstari, ambayo itasimamisha kivinjari chako kwa kipindi cha uboreshaji huu, au chinichini, ambayo itaunda mchakato wa chinichini kuleta data yako ya zamani ya syslog kutoka jedwali la nakala ya akiba hadi umbizo jipya la syslog. Tena mchakato huu unaweza kuchukua saa kadhaa. Truncate huondoa tu syslog iliyohifadhiwa na ujumbe ulioondolewa; sheria za tahadhari, uondoaji na ripoti huhifadhiwa kila wakati."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Safisha Jedwali la Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Uboreshaji wa Ndani kwa Ndani"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Uboreshaji wa Mandharinyuma"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Injini ya Uhifadhi wa Hifadhidata"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Injini ya hifadhi kwa majedwali ya uchanganuzi. Ni injini za hifadhi za InnoDB pekee na, kwenye MariaDB, Aria ndizo zinazotumika. Chaguo lolote la Kikusanya Data cha Mbali linahitaji InnoDB; michanganyiko isiyooana haiwezi kuwasilishwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "Hifadhi ya InnoDB"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Hifadhi ya Aria"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Usahihi wa Muhuri wa Muda"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Usahihi wa milisekunde huhifadhi mihuri ya muda ya Syslog chini ya sekunde katika safu wima ya TIMESTAMP(3) na unapatikana kwenye MariaDB pekee.  Usahihi wa sekunde hutumia safu wima ya kawaida ya TIMESTAMP.  Kwenye mfumo wa uzalishaji, tumia cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms wakati wa muda wa matengenezo ili kubadilisha ujumbe uliopo bila kuutupa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Milisekunde - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB pekee)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Sekunde - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Uchakataji wa Ujumbe wa Mbali"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Washa Uchakataji wa Ujumbe wa Kikusanya Data cha Mbali"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Ikiwa Wakusanyaji Data wako wa Mbali wana hifadhidata zao za Syslog na wanachakata ujumbe wao kwa kujitegemea, teua kisanduku hiki cha kuteua. Kwa kuteua Kisanduku hiki cha kuteua, Wakusanyaji Data wako wa Mbali watahitaji kutunza faili yao wenyewe ya 'config_local.php' ili kuarifu Syslog kutumia hifadhidata inayojitegemea kwa ajili ya kuonyesha na kuchakata ujumbe. Tafadhali tumia faili ya kiolezo 'config_local.php.dist' kwa madhumuni haya. ONYO: Majedwali ya Syslog yataundwa kiotomatiki mara tu chaguo hili litakapowashwa."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Usawazishaji wa Kanuni za Kikusanya Data cha Mbali"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Ikiwa Wakusanyaji Data wako wa Mbali wana hifadhidata zao za Syslog na wanachakata ujumbe wao kwa kujitegemea, teua kisanduku hiki cha kuteua ikiwa ungependa kanuni za Arifa, Uondoaji na Ripoti za hifadhidata Kuu za Cacti zitumwe kwa Mfumo wa Mbali wa Cacti."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Hifadhi Rekodi kwenye Kikusanyaji cha Mbali"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Tunza ujumbe uliosindikwa katika jedwali la syslog la mkusanyaji wa mbali baada ya kuwasilishwa kwa Mkusanyaji Mkuu. Inapozimwa, rekodi huhifadhiwa ndani tu wakati Mkusanyaji Mkuu hapatikani na huondolewa baada ya uthibitisho wa uwasilishaji wa urejeshaji."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Sera ya Uhifadhi"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Chagua idadi ya siku za thamani za Syslog unazopenda kutunza katika hifadhidata."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Kiwango cha Ugawanyaji wa Sehemu"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Ukubwa wa kila sehemu ya majedwali ya syslog na syslog_removed. Kila siku inapendekezwa. Kila saa kunahitaji uhifadhi wenye kikomo, na uhifadhi pamoja na kiwango cha ugawaji lazima vitoshee kikomo cha ugawaji cha seva ya hifadhidata. Ili kubadilisha kiwango baadaye, kibadilishe katika Mipangilio na uendeshe cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Boresha"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Sakinisha"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Mshauri wa Syslog %s"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "ONYO: Usasishaji wa Syslog Unachukua Muda Mrefu!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Uboreshaji wa jedwali la 'main' la Syslog unaweza kuwa mchakato unaochukua muda mrefu sana.  Kwa hivyo, inapendekezwa upunguze ukubwa wa jedwali lako la Syslog kabla ya kuboresha, au uchague chaguo la chinichini."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Ukichagua chaguo la chinichini, jedwali lako la zamani la syslog litabadilishwa jina, na jedwali jipya la syslog litaundwa. Kisha, mchakato wa uboreshaji utaanzishwa chinichini. Tena, mchakato huu wa chinichini unaweza kuchukua muda mrefu kukamilika. Hata hivyo, data yako itahifadhiwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Bila kujali chaguo lako, kanuni zote zilizopo za uondoaji na tahadhari zitahifadhiwa wakati wa mchakato wa kuboresha."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Bonyeza <b>'Boresha'</b> ili kuendelea na uboreshaji, au <b>'Ghairi'</b> ili kurudi kwenye menyu ya Programu-jalizi."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Unaweza pia kuweka injini ya uhifadhi wa hifadhidata kwa majedwali ya uchanganuzi syslog na syslog_remove. Ni injini ya uhifadhi ya InnoDB pekee na, kwenye MariaDB, injini ya uhifadhi ya Aria ndizo zinazotumika. Ikiwa unatumia MariaDB, tunapendekeza Injini ya Uhifadhi ya Aria wakati hakuna chaguo za Kikusanyaji cha Data cha Mbali zilizowashwa; chaguo za kikusanyaji zinahitaji InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Una chaguo kadhaa za kuchagua unapoweka Syslog.  Ya kwanza ni Muundo wa Hifadhidata.  Majedwali yaliyogawanywa ndiyo muundo pekee unaotumika kwani yanazuia ukubwa wa majedwali kuwa mkubwa kupita kiasi na hivyo kupunguza kasi ya hoja.  Majedwali ya kawaida yasiyogawanywa yamepitwa na wakati na hayatolewi tena kwa usakinishaji mpya."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Unaweza pia kuchagua usahihi wa muhuri wa muda. Usahihi wa milisekunde (TIMESTAMP(3)) huhifadhi mpangilio wa chini ya sekunde wa ujumbe unaoingia na unapatikana kwenye MariaDB pekee; usakinishaji wa MySQL hutumia usahihi wa sekunde. Hii haiwezi kubadilishwa papo hapo baadaye bila kuharibu ujumbe uliohifadhiwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Hifadhi ya Aria haipatikani wakati chaguo lolote la Kikusanyaji Data cha Mbali limewashwa. InnoDB imechaguliwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Unaweza pia kuchagua muda wa uhifadhi. Tafadhali kumbuka kuwa ikiwa una vipangishi kadhaa vinavyoweka kumbukumbu kwenye syslog, jedwali hili linaweza kuwa kubwa sana."

