#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Jumla"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog Imewashwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Ikiwa kisanduku hiki cha kuteua kimewekwa, rekodi zitahamishwa kutoka jedwali la Syslog Incoming hadi jedwali kuu la syslog na Arifa na Ripoti zitawashwa. Tafadhali kumbuka kuwa ikiwa mfumo umezimwa maingizo ya kumbukumbu bado yataendelea kujikusanya katika jedwali la Syslog Incoming kwa kuwa hili linadhibitiwa na mchakato wa rsyslog au syslog-ng."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "Sambaza kengele kwa Kidhibiti cha Kengele"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Ruhusu kanuni zilizowekwa kwenye Kidhibiti cha Kengele kusambaza kengele. Barua Pepe ya Syslog inasalia kuwa mbadala; vitendo vya amri huendeshwa tu kwa kanuni za Kengele za Syslog."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Ondoa Vikoa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Orodha iliyotenganishwa kwa koma ya vikoa unavyotaka kuondoa kutoka kwa jina la kipangishi la syslog, Mifano itakuwa 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Muda wa Kuonyesha Upya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Huu ni muda katika sekunde kabla ya ukurasa kuonyeshwa upya."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Ruka Jumla ya Hesabu ya Safumlalo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Ikiwa kisanduku hiki cha kuteua kimewekwa, vichupo vya Kumbukumbu za Mfumo na Kumbukumbu za Arifa havihesabu kila rekodi inayolingana, jambo ambalo linaweza kugharimu rasilimali nyingi kwenye usakinishaji mkubwa. Ukurasa huonyesha viungo vya Iliyotangulia na Inayofuata badala ya jumla na orodha ya kurasa, na Inayofuata hutolewa wakati rekodi zaidi zimesalia."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Idadi ya Juu ya Rekodi za Ripoti"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Kwa Arifa zinazotegemea Kizingiti, ni idadi gani ya juu zaidi unayotaka kuonyesha katika ripoti. Hii hutumika kudhibiti ukubwa wa kumbukumbu ya html na Barua Pepe."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "Rekodi %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Idadi ya Juu ya Michakato ya Uchakataji wa Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Inapowekwa zaidi ya 1, uchakataji wa ujumbe unaoingia husambazwa katika michakato sambamba ya wafanyakazi. Kila mfanyakazi hushughulikia safu tofauti ya ujumbe unaoingia, akiharakisha utatuzi wa majina ya vipangishi na uhamishaji wa ujumbe chini ya mzigo mzito. Mpangilio wa 1 huchakata ujumbe wote katika mchakato mmoja. Michakato ya wafanyakazi haitumiki kwenye Windows au wakati viendelezi vya PHP pcntl na POSIX havipatikani, ambapo uchakataji hurudi kwenye mchakato mmoja."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "Mchakato %d wa Kazi"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "Michakato %d ya Kazi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Amri ya Kufungua Tiketi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Amri hii itatekelezwa kwa kufungua Tiketi za Dawati la Usaidizi.  Amri itahitajika kuchanganua vigezo vingi vya ingizo kama ifuatavyo: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  Orodha ya vipangishi itakuwa orodha iliyotenganishwa kwa koma ya vipangishi vilivyoathiriwa na tahadhari."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Chaguo za Ugunduzi wa Kipangishi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Washa Utatuzi wa Jina la Kipangishi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Ikiwa kisanduku hiki cha kuteua kimewekwa, majina yote ya vipangishi hutafutwa kupitia DNS kwanza (Ikiwa imewashwa), kwa kutumia rekodi za A na AAAA. Anwani za IPv4 na IPv6 hazihitaji utafutaji, na anwani za IPv6 huhifadhiwa katika umbizo lililobanwa la herufi ndogo. Ikiwa utafutaji wa DNS utashindwa, mfumo utajaribu kutafuta jina la kipangishi dhidi ya jedwali la kipangishi la Cacti na kulibadilisha na maelezo ya kipangishi cha Cacti. Ikiwa utafutaji wa DNS na Cacti utashindwa, rekodi hupewa kiambishi awali 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Ruka Utatuzi wa DNS kwa vipangishi vinavyoingia"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Ikiwa kisanduku hiki cha kuteua kimewekwa, mfumo hautajaribu kutafuta vipangishi kupitia utafutaji wa DNS. Hii ni muhimu kwa mazingira ambapo utatuzi wa DNS hauwezekani au hautakiwi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Arifa za HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Washa Barua Pepe ya Msingi wa HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Ikiwa kisanduku hiki cha kuteua kimewekwa, Barua Pepe zote zitatumwa katika umbizo la HTML. Vinginevyo, Barua Pepe zitatumwa kama maandishi wazi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Faili la Umbizo la Kutumia"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Chagua kifungio maalum cha html na faili la CSS la kutumia.  Faili hili lina html na CSS za kufunga ripoti yako.  Ikiwa lina zaidi ya CSS pekee, unahitaji kuweka lebo maalum ya <REPORT> ndani ya faili.  Lebo hii ya umbizo itabadilishwa na maudhui ya ripoti.  Faili hizi ziko katika saraka ya 'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Uhifadhi wa Data na Ugawaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Uhifadhi wa Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya siku za kuhifadhi matukio."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Ukubwa wa kila sehemu ya majedwali ya syslog na syslog_removed. Mabadiliko yanahifadhiwa hapa lakini yanaanza kutumika tu wakati cli/upgrade_partitioning.php inapojenga upya majedwali yote mawili; hadi wakati huo, matengenezo ya sehemu huhifadhi ukubwa uliopo. Ugawaji wa kila saa unahitaji uhifadhi wenye kikomo. Uhifadhi, dirisha la kuunda awali na kiwango cha ugawaji kwa pamoja lazima vitoshee kikomo cha ugawaji cha seva ya hifadhidata, la sivyo mipangilio haitahifadhiwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Kipindi cha Kuunda Sehemu Mapema"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya siku za sehemu za baadaye za kudumisha kwa majedwali yaliyogawanywa ya Syslog, ili sehemu mpya zigawanywe kila wakati kutoka kwenye sehemu tupu ya dMaxValue. Ugawanyaji wa kila saa hudumisha angalau siku 2 kila wakati."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "Siku %d"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "Siku %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Kikomo cha Urejeshaji wa Sehemu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Wakati vigawanyo vinapokosekana (kwa mfano baada ya muda wa kusimama kwa matengenezo), kwa kiwango cha juu idadi hii ya vigawanyo vinavyokosekana kwa kila jedwali huundwa katika kila uendeshaji wa kikusanyaji. Pengo lililosalia hujazwa katika uendeshaji unaofuata; upunguzaji wa uhifadhi huahirishwa hadi upeo wa vigawanyo vya baadaye urejeshwe kikamilifu. Inatumika kwa majedwali ya Syslog yaliyogawanywa pekee."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "Kigawanyo %d kwa kila uendeshaji"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "Vigawanyo %d kwa kila uendeshaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha Uchakavu wa Data ya Kikusanyaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
msgstr "Tahadhari za afya ya mtiririko wa uchakataji huonya wakati ujumbe ambao haujachakatwa, ukamilishaji wa uchakataji, au usawazishaji ulio kwenye foleni unazidi ucheleweshaji huu. Ucheleweshaji halisi ni angalau vipindi vitatu vya kikusanyaji na sekunde 300. Weka 0 ili kutumia sekunde 300."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (300 seconds)"
msgstr "Chaguo-msingi (sekunde 300)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d seconds"
msgstr "sekunde %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Backlog Threshold"
msgstr "Kizingiti cha Mrundikano wa Kikusanyaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Syslog Status page shows a warning when more than this many messages sit unprocessed in the Syslog Incoming table.  Set to 0 to use the default of 10000 messages."
msgstr "Ukurasa wa Hali ya Syslog unaonyesha onyo wakati ujumbe mwingi zaidi ya huu umekaa bila kuchakatwa katika jedwali la Syslog Incoming. Weka 0 ili kutumia chaguo-msingi la ujumbe 10000."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (10000 messages)"
msgstr "Chaguo-msingi (ujumbe 10000)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Messages"
msgstr "Ujumbe %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Tahadhari za Afya ya Mtiririko wa Uchakataji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Orodha ya Arifa za Afya ya Mtiririko wa Uchakataji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Chagua orodha iliyopo ya arifa za Thold kwa arifa za afya ya mtiririko. Wapokeaji wa orodha iliyowashwa wanaunganishwa na anwani za barua pepe zilizo hapa chini, huku wapokeaji wa BCC wakihifadhiwa. Orodha zinahitaji jedwali la orodha ya arifa za Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Wapokeaji wa Barua Pepe ya Afya ya Mtiririko wa Uchakataji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Wapokeaji wa barua pepe waliotenganishwa kwa mkato kwa hitilafu na urejeshaji wa mkondo. Acha wazi na usichague orodha ya arifa ili kuzima barua pepe; hali ya afya inaendelea kuonekana kwenye kichupo cha Hali na mabadiliko ya hali yanarekodiwa kwenye kumbukumbu. Ukaguzi unahitaji Kikusanyaji cha Cacti kiwe kinaendeshwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Muda wa Ukumbusho wa Afya ya Mtiririko wa Uchakataji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Rudia arifa kwa matatizo yanayoendelea ya mkondo baada ya muda huu. Majaribio ya barua pepe yaliyoshindwa hujaribiwa tena si zaidi ya mara moja kila baada ya dakika tano."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Uhifadhi wa Tahadhari za Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Hii ni idadi ya siku za kuhifadhi kumbukumbu za arifa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Uzuiaji wa Tahadhari na Matengenezo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Siku za Dirisha la Matengenezo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Days when all alert notifications are muted during the configured maintenance timeframe."
msgstr "Siku ambapo arifa zote za tahadhari hunyamazishwa wakati wa muda wa matengenezo uliowekwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Starts"
msgstr "Dirisha la Matengenezo Linaanza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local start time for the global maintenance window."
msgstr "Saa ya kuanza ya ndani kwa kipindi cha matengenezo cha jumla."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Dirisha la Matengenezo Linaisha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Saa ya mwisho ya ndani kwa kipindi cha matengenezo cha jumla. Saa ya mwisho ya mapema zaidi inaendelea hadi siku inayofuata."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Matengenezo ya Mara Moja Yanaanza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Tarehe na saa ya ndani ya hiari ya kuanza kipindi cha matengenezo ya jumla ya mara moja."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Matengenezo ya Mara Moja Yanaisha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Tarehe na saa ya ndani ya hiari ya kumaliza kipindi cha matengenezo ya jumla ya mara moja. Umbizo: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Muda Chaguo-msingi wa Kupoa kwa Tahadhari"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Zuia arifa yoyote ya marudio kwa kanuni sawa na upeo wa kuripoti kwa idadi hii ya dakika. Thamani za kila kanuni hubatilisha mpangilio huu. Weka 0 ili kuzima."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
msgstr "Uzuiwaji Chaguo-msingi wa Urudiaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress a notification with the same matched message set for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Zuia arifa yenye seti sawa ya ujumbe uliolingana kwa idadi hii ya dakika. Thamani za kila kanuni hubatilisha mpangilio huu. Weka 0 ili kuzima."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Syslog Recovery"
msgstr "Urejeshaji wa Syslog ya Mbali"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Recovery Records Per Execution"
msgstr "Idadi ya Juu ya Rekodi za Urejeshaji kwa Kila Utekelezaji"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of retained remote Syslog events sent to the Main Collector by one recovery worker execution. Each central database transaction remains capped at 100 records. Increase gradually while observing Main Collector load and lock waits."
msgstr "Idadi ya juu ya matukio ya Syslog ya mbali yaliyohifadhiwa yanayotumwa kwa Kikusanyaji Kikuu katika utekelezaji mmoja wa mchakato wa urejeshaji. Kila muamala wa hifadhidata kuu unasalia na kikomo cha rekodi 100. Ongeza hatua kwa hatua huku ukifuatilia mzigo wa Kikusanyaji Kikuu na muda wa kusubiri kufuli."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Recovery Pause Between Batches"
msgstr "Sitisho la Urejesho Kati ya Mafungu"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pause between each 100-record Main Collector delivery transaction. A longer pause lowers Main Collector pressure; a shorter pause speeds backlog convergence."
msgstr "Sitisha kati ya kila muamala wa uwasilishaji wa rekodi 100 wa Kikusanyaji Kikuu. Kusitisha kwa muda mrefu kunapunguza shinikizo la Kikusanyaji Kikuu; kusitisha kwa muda mfupi kunaharakisha upunguzaji wa mlundikano."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "No pause"
msgstr "Hakuna kusitisha"

