#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message code to look for, for example %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN or 4625. It must equal a whole word of the syslog message (letters, digits and _ . - /); a leading % is literal and must match as written. The match is not case sensitive. See How Recommendations Are Matched on the list page."
msgstr "Msimbo wa ujumbe wa kutafuta, kwa mfano %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN au 4625. Lazima ulingane na neno zima la ujumbe wa syslog (herufi, tarakimu na _ . - /); alama ya % mwanzoni ni halisi na lazima ilingane jinsi ilivyoandikwa. Ulinganishaji hauzingatii herufi kubwa au ndogo. Tazama Jinsi Mapendekezo Yanavyolinganishwa kwenye ukurasa wa orodha."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Component"
msgstr "Kipengele"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The facility, module or subsystem that raises the message."
msgstr "Kituo, moduli au mfumo mdogo unaoibua ujumbe."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
