#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [edit]"
msgstr "Pendekezo [hariri]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [new]"
msgstr "Pendekezo [mpya]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A lightbulb before the message marks matching recommendations on the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs. Click the message to read them in the details flyout. Hovering never requests the server."
msgstr "Balbu kabla ya ujumbe inaonyesha mapendekezo yanayolingana kwenye vichupo vya Kumbukumbu za Mfumo na Kumbukumbu za Tahadhari. Bofya ujumbe ili uyasome kwenye dirisha la maelezo. Kuelea juu yake kamwe hakuombi seva."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Only the <b>Identifier</b> column is used for matching. The vendor, component, severity, message and explanation are shown in the details flyout but are never searched."
msgstr "Safu wima ya <b>Kitambulishi</b> pekee ndiyo inayotumika kwa ulinganisho. Mchuuzi, kijenzi, ukali, ujumbe na maelezo huonyeshwa katika kidirisha cha maelezo lakini hazitafutwi kamwe."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The first 2,048 characters of the message are split into words. A word is a run of letters, digits and the characters _ . - / that may start with %. Every other character, such as a space, colon, comma or bracket, ends a word. In <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> the words are <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> and <code>down</code>."
msgstr "Herufi 2,048 za kwanza za ujumbe hugawanywa katika maneno. Neno ni mfululizo wa herufi, tarakimu na alama _ . - / ambazo zinaweza kuanza na %. Alama nyingine yoyote, kama vile nafasi, nukta pacha, mkato au mabano, humaliza neno. Katika <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> maneno ni <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> na <code>down</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "An identifier matches when it is <b>exactly equal to one whole word</b>, ignoring case. It is not a \"contains\", \"starts with\" or \"ends with\" search, and there are no wildcards: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> does not match the word <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, and <code>UPDOWN</code> does not match <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."
msgstr "Kitambulishi hulingana wakati kiko <b>sawa kabisa na neno moja zima</b>, bila kuzingatia herufi kubwa au ndogo. Sio utafutaji wa \"ina\", \"inaanza na\" au \"inaishia na\", na hakuna alama badala (wildcards): <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> hailingani na neno <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, na <code>UPDOWN</code> hailingani na <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A leading <b>%</b> is literal, not a wildcard, and must match the message word as written. An identifier <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> matches the message word <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, not <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; an identifier without the prefix matches only the unprefixed word."
msgstr "Alama ya <b>%</b> mwanzoni ni halisi, si alama ya mbadala, na lazima ilingane na neno la ujumbe jinsi lilivyoandikwa. Kitambulisho <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> kinalingana na neno la ujumbe <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, si <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; kitambulisho kisicho na kiambishi awali kinalingana na neno lisilo na kiambishi awali pekee."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "When the syslog host is a Cacti device whose vendor is recognised from its SNMP system description or device template, and recommendations exist for that vendor, only that vendor's recommendations and those without a vendor are checked. Otherwise all vendors are checked, but an identifier made only of digits matches only recommendations without a vendor. When several recommendations match, the longest identifiers are shown first, up to three."
msgstr "Wakati kipangishi cha syslog ni kifaa cha Cacti ambacho mchuuzi wake anatambuliwa kutoka kwa maelezo yake ya mfumo wa SNMP au kiolezo cha kifaa, na mapendekezo yapo kwa mchuuzi huyo, ni mapendekezo ya mchuuzi huyo pekee na yale yasiyo na mchuuzi ndiyo yanakaguliwa. Vinginevyo wachuuzi wote wanakaguliwa, lakini kitambulishi kilichoundwa kwa tarakimu pekee kinalingana tu na mapendekezo yasiyo na mchuuzi. Wakati mapendekezo kadhaa yanalingana, vitambulishi virefu zaidi huonyeshwa kwanza, hadi vitatu."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifiers that contain other characters, such as the <code>#</code> slot placeholder or the <code>|</code> alternatives in some vendor documentation (for example <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), are kept and exported but can never match. Set <b>Can Match</b> to No to list them, and edit them into the exact code, for example <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."
msgstr "Vitambulishi vyenye herufi au alama nyingine, kama vile kishikilia nafasi cha <code>#</code> au vibadala vya <code>|</code> katika nyaraka za baadhi ya wachuuzi (kwa mfano <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), huhifadhiwa na kuhamishwa lakini haviwezi kulingana kamwe. Weka <b>Inaweza Kulingana</b> kuwa Hapana ili kuviorodhesha, na uvihariri viwe msimbo kamili, kwa mfano <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."

