#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "No shared search templates. Save a search for all users from Syslog to create one."
msgstr "Hakuna violezo vya utafutaji vilivyoshirikiwa. Hifadhi utafutaji kwa watumiaji wote kutoka Syslog ili kuunda kimoja."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Export the following Saved Search Template(s)."
msgstr "Bofya 'Endelea' ili Kuhamisha Kiolezo/Violezo vya Utafutaji Vilivyohifadhiwa vifuatavyo."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Delete the following Saved Search Template(s)."
msgstr "Bofya 'Endelea' ili Kufuta Kiolezo/Violezo vya Utafutaji Uliohifadhiwa vifuatavyo."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Delete Saved Search Template(s)"
msgstr "Futa Violezo vya Utafutaji Vilivyohifadhiwa"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Export Saved Search Template(s)"
msgstr "Hamisha Violezo vya Utafutaji Vilivyohifadhiwa"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
#, php-format
msgid "NOTE: Imported %d and updated %d Saved Search Template(s)."
msgstr "KUMBUKA: Imeleta %d na kusasisha Violezo %d vya Utafutaji Uliohifadhiwa."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
#, php-format
msgid "ERROR: %d Saved Search Template(s) failed to import."
msgstr "HITILAFU: Violezo %d vya Utafutaji Uliohifadhiwa vilishindwa kuingizwa."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Import Saved Search Template from Local File"
msgstr "Leta Kiolezo cha Utafutaji Kilichohifadhiwa kutoka Faili ya Ndani"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "If the JSON file containing the Saved Search Template definition data is located on your local machine, select it here."
msgstr "Ikiwa faili ya JSON yenye data ya ufafanuzi wa Kiolezo cha Utafutaji Uliohifadhiwa iko kwenye mashine yako ya ndani, ichague hapa."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Import Saved Search Template from Text"
msgstr "Leta Kiolezo cha Utafutaji Kilichohifadhiwa kutoka Maandishi"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "If you have the JSON file containing the Saved Search Template definition data as text, you can paste it into this box to import it."
msgstr "Ikiwa una faili ya JSON yenye data ya ufafanuzi wa Kiolezo cha Utafutaji Uliohifadhiwa kama maandishi, unaweza kuibandika kwenye kisanduku hiki ili kuiagiza."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Import Saved Search Template"
msgstr "Leta Kiolezo cha Utafutaji Kilichohifadhiwa"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Edit Saved Search Template"
msgstr "Hariri Kiolezo cha Utafutaji Uliohifadhiwa"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "The name shown to all users in Saved Searches."
msgstr "Jina linaloonyeshwa kwa watumiaji wote katika Utafutaji Uliohifadhiwa."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "The account that owns this template and can manage it in Saved Searches."
msgstr "Akaunti inayomiliki kiolezo hiki na inayoweza kukidhibiti katika Utafutaji Uliohifadhiwa."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Users who can use this template in addition to its owner. All Users shares it with everyone."
msgstr "Watumiaji wanaoweza kutumia kiolezo hiki pamoja na mmiliki wake. Watumiaji Wote huishiriki na kila mtu."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Groups who can use this template in addition to its owner. All Groups shares it with everyone."
msgstr "Vikundi vinavyoweza kutumia kiolezo hiki pamoja na mmiliki wake. Vikundi Vyote hukishiriki na kila mtu."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Search Query"
msgstr "Hoji ya Utafutaji"

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Correct the query syntax to use the query builder."
msgstr "Sahihisha sintaksia ya hoja ili kutumia kijenzi cha hoja."

#: syslog_saved_searches.php
msgid "Choose a field, operator, and value. Use AND, OR, NOT, or Group to build the query. Changes apply to this shared template for all users."
msgstr "Chagua sehemu, kiendeshaji, na thamani. Tumia AND, OR, NOT, au Group ili kuunda hoja. Mabadiliko yanatumika kwenye kiolezo hiki kilichoshirikiwa kwa watumiaji wote."

